% expect-output: 2
% expect-output: true
% expect-output: false
% expect-output: true
% expect-output: true
% Scenario: a shading pattern instance is made. A dictionary with
% PatternType 2 and an axial Shading is given to makepattern: the result
% carries the prototype's entries and an Implementation entry, the
% prototype gains nothing, setpattern accepts the instance, and
% currentcolor answers it.
/D << /PatternType 2 /Shading << /ShadingType 2 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB /Coords [0 0 1 0]
  /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [1 0 0] /C1 [0 0 1] /N 1 >> >> >> def
/P D matrix makepattern def
P /PatternType get =
P /Implementation known =
D /Implementation known =
P setpattern
currentcolorspace 0 get /Pattern eq =
currentcolor P eq =
